      "kind": "counter",
      "text": "Prepare an answer before you assert: Thomas Edison broke through with \"However, your premise assumes what it needs to prove, and the data shows otherwise. When the measured results are compared across studies,…\" (Clean argument. structure=1.00, evidence=1.00).",
