    {
      "id": "technique:s56t90",
      "kind": "technique",
      "text": "Borrow this pattern from Thomas Edison: \"However, your premise assumes what it needs to prove, and the data shows otherwise. When the measured results are compared across studies,…\" — it carried evidence, its premises led cleanly to the conclusion.",
